lly.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Emdash\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/emdash\",\n    \"description\": \"One app that manages every coding agent with open-source integration.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"agent management\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Running parallel agents on isolated worktrees is brilliant for testing features\",\n      \"SSH support makes remote development seamless\",\n      \"Finally a unified interface for all my coding agents\",\n      \"Open-source integrations are a huge plus\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Runtime\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/runtime\",\n    \"description\": \"Sandboxed coding agents for everyone on your team with Slack integration.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"open-source coding agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Re_gent\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/re-gent\",\n    \"description\": \"Version Control for AI agent activity to track changes and rollbacks.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"agent infrastructure\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Viberia\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/viberia\",\n    \"description\": \"Command AI agents like you're playing Civilization with orchestration controls.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Glia\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/glia\",\n    \"description\": \"Local-first AI memory bridge between browser chats and IDEs.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"workspace memory\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Contextberg\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/contextberg\",\n    \"description\": \"Turn your work into AI agent memory, served over MCP protocol.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-20\",\n    \"category\": \"workspace memory\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ShioriCode\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/shioricode\",\n    \"description\": \"Open-source alternative to Codex & Claude Code for AI-assisted development.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"open-source coding agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Drizz\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/drizz\",\n    \"description\": \"Mobile tests that write, run, and fix themselves autonomously.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"testing tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CtrlOps\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/ctrlops\",\n    \"description\": \"Deploy, Debug & Manage Linux Servers with AI assistance.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"orchestration agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Haystack\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/haystack\",\n    \"description\": \"Review only the pull requests that actually need human attention with AI.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-19\",\n    \"category\": \"code review\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LobeHub\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/lobehub\",\n    \"descrip